<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Mustek doubles half year pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Mustek doubles half year pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings shr (cts)    19.1	  vs 10.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   28.88	 vs 13.64</p>
<p>    Tax			 10.12	 vs 4.77</p>
<p>    Turnover		  451.84	vs 212.78</p>
<p>Full name: Mustek</p>
<p>NOTE - South Africa's Mustek is to list in the Johannesburg Stock Exchange's electronics scetor on April 3. It said current trading since December had been strong.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
